==English==

===Etymology===
1.'''FUCK YOU!!!!!!!!!!! '''2. From the earlier form {{term|han't}}, a contraction of {{term|has}} {{term|not}} and {{term|have}} {{term|not}}. ''Han't'' shifted from {{IPA|/hænt/}} to {{IPA|/heɪnt/}}, and underwent h-dropping in most dialects.

